          "label": "bug",
          "marked": false,
          "text": "**Revises an earlier Kody suggestion** on `src/billing/status.ts:8` (2026-09-30 00:46 UTC).\n\nPropagating `NotReadyError` from `fetchStatus` triggers `pollCharge` to resubmit a charge the gateway already holds, and because `gw.submit` is non-idempotent, accepted-but-pending charges can be duplicated. Reconcile the `NotReadyError` contract between `errors.ts` and `poller.ts` so `pollCharge` retries or repolls instead of calling `gw.submit`."
